And he said to me, Jenna, I moved to Texas in middle school, and I had that same conversation.

35
00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:35.880
Someone said, just Chunk It.

36
00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:36.820
And I said, what?

37
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:37.600
Chunk It?

38
00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:39.000
He's like, they say it.

39
00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:39.520
They do.

40
00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:40.900
It's like pop and soda.

41
00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:42.180
Thank you.

42
00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:42.540
Right?

43
00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:43.540
Thank you.

44
00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:44.540
And I guess in St.

45
00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:45.140
Sorry, Texas.

46
00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:46.540
Don't be sorry.

47
00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:47.720
Just Chunk It.

48
00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:52.540
And I guess in St. Louis, they say, I'm going to lie on the table.

49
00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:53.200
No.

50
00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:55.340
Lay out all your cards.

51
