69
00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:52.940
Jenna, that was a fantastic summary.

70
00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:53.760
Thank you.

71
00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:54.680
Well done.

72
00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:55.580
