00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:10.580
They're like, we'll just do one more.

263
00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:11.080
Let's do it.

264
00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:14.580
On that last take, John hit the seam.

265
00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:15.420
By accident.

266
00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:19.800
