272
00:10:29.180 --> 00:10:33.000
You can see his shoulders, and he very quickly, oh, he's such a pro.

273
00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:35.500
He turns his back in his face to the camera.

274
00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:35.960
He, like, dives out of the seam.

275
00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:37.180
Yeah, he just, like, leaves.

276
00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:39.280
Phyllis was really surprised, too.

277
00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:42.700
I swear you can hear somebody say, what?

278
00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:47.660
Like, either John or Rain is like, what is happening?

279
00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:49.860
And they were going to cut that out.

280
00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.260
They were like, oh, my gosh.

281
00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:52.060
We're so sorry, Rain.

282
00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:52.800
Are you all right?

283
00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:54.180
We were laughing so hard.

284
00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:59.320
And when they went in to edit the episode, they put in what was scripted.

285
00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:01.260
