00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:38.100
And Greg was a buddy of mine, and he had never done a single camera show before.

326
00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:43.220
And NBC wanted to know if I wanted to consult on that while I was developing, you know, just

327
00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:44.660
