00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:58.040
And I was screening the pilot of the Bernie Mac show.

332
00:12:59.510 --> 00:13:04.490
The producer on the original Office was screening the comic relief episode, I think, of The Office,

333
00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:06.530
the one where they wear the red noses, that one.

334
00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:06.990
Yeah.

335
00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:09.910
And I had never seen The Office before, and it was great, of course, you know.

336
00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:12.910
And we were all, like, congratulating each other afterwards.

337
00:13:13.130 --> 00:13:16.490
