00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:30.110
I don't work in the American version of The Office.

344
00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:33.790
And it's funny, in the beginning, this is something, I don't know if you guys, how much you

345
00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:39.510
realize in the beginning of what was going on, that there was a lot of negativity in

346
00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:40.870
showbiz about our show.

