374
00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:57.640
And I just remember that first season of The Office, we really were just sort of like

375
00:14:57.640 --> 00:14:59.040
on our own, it felt like.

376
00:14:59.260 --> 00:14:59.660
Yeah.

377
00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:01.360
We were the little engine that could.

378
00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:04.280
What was it like in the writer's room?

379
00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:07.560
The way the writer's room went on The Office, especially in the early days, was whatever

380
00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:11.200
idea we had would go in a little index card and would be slapped on the wall.

381
00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:14.580
You know, after a while, we had all these ideas that were just slapped on the wall that

382
00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:17.480
