00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:45.020
You know, even though we each went out and wrote a draft, we all contributed to the episode

390
00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:47.080
before it went out, and of course, when it came back in.

391
00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:48.340
You know, and that was a lot of fun.

392
00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:52.780
My one regret was, in the second season, I came up with that Halloween episode idea, and

393
00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:54.000
I really wanted to write that one.

